+## Notes
 
+### Node 25 and localStorage
 
-## Documentation
+Node 25 ships a built-in `localStorage` global that has no working methods unless you configure a
+backing store. Libraries that feature-detect it (`next-themes`, RainbowKit) find it and crash with
+`TypeError: localStorage.getItem is not a function` — during `next dev` SSR *and* during static
+prerendering.
 
-Visit our [docs](https://docs.scaffoldeth.io) to learn how to start building with Scaffold-ETH 2.
+`packages/nextjs/polyfill-localstorage.cjs` installs a working in-memory shim, and the `dev`,
+`serve` and `build:ipfs` scripts inject it with
+`NODE_OPTIONS="--require ./polyfill-localstorage.cjs"`. It has to travel in `NODE_OPTIONS` because
+Next.js prerenders in separate worker processes that neither `next.config.ts` nor
+`instrumentation.ts` reaches. It is a no-op on Node < 25.
 
-To know more about its features, check out our [website](https://scaffoldeth.io).
+### Don't run a production build against a live dev server
 
-## Contributing to Scaffold-ETH 2
+`yarn ipfs:build` deletes `.next` before building. If `yarn start` is running at the same time it
+loses its build output and starts serving a page that never hydrates. Stop the dev server first.
 
-We welcome contributions to Scaffold-ETH 2!
+### Going to real Base
 
-Please see [CONTRIBUTING.MD](https://github.com/scaffold-eth/scaffold-eth-2/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) for more information and guidelines for contributing to Scaffold-ETH 2.
